# 11. Main.java (Standalone Revision)

Use this class to revise the Factory flow without starting Spring.

For this standalone example, we manually supply the processor implementations to the Factory.


package com.example.payment;

import java.util.List;

public class Main {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        // 1. Create implementations
        List<PaymentProcessor> processors = List.of(
                new UpiPayment(),
                new CreditCardPayment(),
                new WalletPayment()
        );

        // 2. Create Factory
        PaymentProcessorFactory factory =
                new PaymentProcessorFactory(processors);

        // 3. Create Service
        PaymentService service =
                new PaymentService(factory);

        // 4. Process payment
        PaymentResponse response =
                service.processPayment(
                        PaymentMethod.UPI,
                        new PaymentRequest(
                                1000.0,
                                "TXN001"
                        )
                );

        // 5. Print response
        System.out.println(response);
    }
}


**Expected output:**

text
PaymentResponse[
    status=SUCCESS,
    message=UPI payment processed
]


