### Core methods to remember

| Method             | Responsibility                                             |
| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| `supports()`       | Identifies which payment method an implementation handles. |
| `process()`        | Executes the implementation-specific payment logic.        |
| `getProcessor()`   | Retrieves the processor for the requested payment method.  |
| `processPayment()` | Delegates payment processing through the Factory.          |

### Key takeaway

**Factory:** Selects the appropriate implementation.

**Strategy:** Defines interchangeable processing implementations.

**Spring:** Manages bean creation and dependency injection.

The `Main` class demonstrates the flow manually, while `PaymentApplication` starts the Spring application.

